  "verified": false,
  "note": "built from the published chart, not tried on hardware. Knob rows a, b, c are top to bottom. A strip's solo is its MUTE button pressed while SOLO is held (button.solo.N). The MUTE and REC ARM LEDs light from a note-on on their own note, so bindings to them get feedback by default. SEND ALL is not mapped.",
  "sources": [
    "Akai Professional MIDImix User Guide (akaipro.com)",
    "Ardour share/midi_maps/AKAI_MIDIMix_Normal_Mode.map and AKAI_MIDIMix_EQ_Mode.map (the factory preset, channel 1)"
  ],
